  "instructions": [
    "In a large skillet, heat the oil over medium-high heat. Add diced beef and sauté until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add onions and garlic to the skillet; cook for another minute or two until softened.",
    "Stir in ground cumin, coriander, turmeric, salt, and lemon juice. Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and stir in fresh cilantro and mint leaves. Serve hot as a side dish with eggs or toast."
